  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2503\">\n<li data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2107\">\n<p data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2036\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2034\">Normal (Disomy 21):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2107\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2079\">\n<p data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2079\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Two fluorescent signals per nucleus.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2107\">\n<p data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2107\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">No evidence of trisomy.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2344\">\n<p data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2141\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2139\">Positive for Trisomy 21:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2344\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2227\">\n<p data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2227\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Three fluorescent signals per nucleus in the majority (&gt;70%) of cells analyzed.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2344\">\n<p data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2344\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Indicates <strong data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2259\">Down Syndrome</strong> &ndash; must be confirmed with <strong data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2305\">full karyotyping</strong> (to detect translocations, mosaicism).</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2503\">\n<p data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2379\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2377\">Mosaicism (Intermediate):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2503\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2439\">\n<p data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2439\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Mixed population of cells with disomy and trisomy 21.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2503\">\n<p data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2503\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Requires further genetic counseling and confirmatory tests.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
